    "updated_at": "2020-11-28T04:24:45Z",
    "body": "> This removes the manifest attribute on the html element, the text/cache-manifest format, the integration of application caches with navigation, the monkey patching of what is now Fetch, and the window.applicationCache API.\r\n> \r\n> Closes #151 and closes #5505.\r\n> \r\n>     * [ ]  At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n>       \r\n>       * [x]  Firefox\r\n>       * [x]  Chrome @quisquous\r\n>       * [ ]  Safari @youennf\r\n> \r\n>     * [ ]  [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n>       \r\n>       * …\r\n> \r\n>     * [ ]  [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n>       \r\n>       * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=582750\r\n>       * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1584984\r\n>       * Safari: …\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> (See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n> \r\n> [/browsing-the-web.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/browsing-the-web.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/browsing-the-web.html) )\r\n> [/iana.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/iana.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/iana.html) )\r\n> [/iframe-embed-object.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/iframe-embed-object.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/iframe-embed-object.html) )\r\n> [/index.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/index.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/index.html) )\r\n> [/indices.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/indices.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/indices.html) )\r\n> [/obsolete.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/obsolete.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/obsolete.html) )\r\n> [/parsing.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/parsing.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/parsing.html) )\r\n> [/rendering.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/rendering.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/rendering.html) )\r\n> [/semantics.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/semantics.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/semantics.html) )\r\n> [/system-state.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/system-state.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/system-state.html) )\r\n> [/web-messaging.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/web-messaging.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/web-messaging.html) )\r\n> [/webappapis.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/webappapis.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/webappapis.html) )\r\n> [/webstorage.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/webstorage.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/webstorage.html) )\r\n> [/window-object.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/window-object.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/window-object.html) )\r\n> [/workers.html](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/workers.html) ( [diff](https://whatpr.org/html/6153/965be23...80336d0/workers.html) )\r\n\r\nHelo",
